# W7g, host a (k5): hosts in stag0101 with b; from @200 its link keeps dropping (half-open cuts of 7 s, 0.2 s apart, until @272): one
# absence episode, the instance ends with the first grace's deadline (host_lost, about @270), a goes home once its link lets it.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander -150 -60 20 until present=2,sealed>=600
log b joined
idle until epoch>=@195
idle until stage=stagml11,control fail epoch>=@360
log a home after the episode
